sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant GA as GitHub Actions publish.yml
  participant OI as GitHub OIDC
  participant CO as cosign
  participant FU as Fulcio
  participant RE as Rekor
  participant GR as GitHub Releases
  participant CL as Client
  GA->>OI: request ID token (id-token write)
  OI-->>GA: JWT naming workflow, repository and ref
  GA->>CO: sign-blob manifest.json
  CO->>CO: ephemeral key pair
  CO->>FU: JWT and public key
  FU-->>CO: short lived certificate
  CO->>RE: signature and certificate
  RE-->>CO: signed entry timestamp
  CO-->>GA: manifest.sigstore.json bundle
  GA->>GR: attach manifest.json and the bundle
  CL->>GR: download both
  CL->>CL: verify chain to the trust root, signature, Rekor evidence, identity, issuer
